                                                        BUSINESS QUESTION
Which products receive the highest proportion of critical and high-priority tickets?


                                                           Query:
SELECT   
    product,
    COUNT(*) AS total_tickets,
    SUM(CASE WHEN priority IN ('Critical', 'High') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS critical_high_tickets,
    ROUND(
        SUM(CASE WHEN priority IN ('Critical', 'High') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 100.0 / COUNT(*), 2
    ) AS proportion_percentage
FROM customer_support
GROUP BY product
ORDER BY proportion_percentage DESC;


                                                                Finding
SecureVault had the highest proportion of Critical and High-priority tickets among all products.


                                                            Why did it happen?
When I investigated further, I found that SecureVault also had the highest average number of customer interactions. This suggests that issues related to SecureVault are generally more
difficult to resolve and usually require more back and forth communication between the customer and the support team.	

                                                 
                                                             Recommendation
The engineering team should review the most common issues affecting SecureVault and fix the recurring problems causing customers to raise Critical and High-priority tickets.
Creating better troubleshooting guides for support agents could also reduce the number of interactions needed before these issues are resolved.
